75329>>>>>>>        
75329>>>>>>>        Move 1 to iArg // Browses only local
75330>>>>>>>        
75330>>>>>>>        Get psDriverID to sDriver
75331>>>>>>>        If (sDriver <> "") Begin
75333>>>>>>>            Move (Repeat(" ", 8192)) to sOutConnStr
75334>>>>>>>            Call_Driver 0 sDRiver Function CLI_BROWSECONNECT Callback 0 Passing sInConnStr sOutConnStr iArg Result iRetval
