75359>>>>>>>    Function EnumerateServers Returns Integer
75361>>>>>>>        
75361>>>>>>>        Integer iNumServers
75361>>>>>>>        Integer iNetworkLocal
75361>>>>>>>        
75361>>>>>>>        Move 0 to iNetworkLocal // 0 = enumerate network servers
75362>>>>>>>        
75362>>>>>>>        Get EnumerateServersNetworkOrLocal iNetworkLocal to iNumServers
75363>>>>>>>        
75363>>>>>>>        Function_Return iNumServers
75364>>>>>>>        
75364>>>>>>>    End_Function
75365>>>>>>>    
75365>>>>>>>    
75365>>>>>>>    //   Enumerate the available SQL Server database servers
