75500>>>>>// Wrapper Function WNetGetUser
75500>>>>>Function WNetGetUser Global ;    Pointer lpName ;    Pointer lpUser_Name ;    Pointer lpLength ;    Returns DWord
75502>>>>>    
75502>>>>>    DWord   dwResult     
75502>>>>>    UWide   uwName uwUserName
75502>>>>>    UWide   uwName uwUserName
75502>>>>>        
75502>>>>>    Send StringToWide lpName (&uwName)
75503>>>>>    
75503>>>>>    Send WideSetBuffer lpUser_Name lpLength (&uwUserName)    
75504>>>>>    
