75626>>>>>        Send AppendTextLn (SFormat (C_$MemoryUtilization, MemoryStatusInfo.dwMemoryLoad))
75627>>>>>        Send AppendTextLn (SFormat (C_$AvailablePhysicalMemory, Integer ( Real (MemoryStatusInfo.ullAvailPhys) / Real (MemoryStatusInfo.ullTotalPhys) * 100.0)))
