75672>>>>>            If (hoWorkspace <> 0) Begin
75674>>>>>                Send EnumerateWorkspaceData of hoWorkspace Self (Refproc (AppendTextLn))
75675>>>>>                Send AppendTextLn ""
75676>>>>>            End
75676>>>>>>
75676>>>>>        End
75676>>>>>>
75676>>>>>    End_Procedure
75677>>>>>    
